{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/081841a874e06fc1f9c7d49956df9eb7.avif?t=1750756210\" width=800 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SETTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun Wukong, Nezha, and Yang Jian, three legendary Chinese mythological characters, face their destined opponents in life, whether they are gods or demons, and confront them head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/62193fcec1d2e314a16e918eb830aa38.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel style: Exquisite Q-version pixel painting style, awakening memories in the mind with a new style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike gameplay: With each new game, the map room is randomly generated: the positions of enemies, treasure chests, and events change, making every experience full of freshness for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skills: The game has many skills, but unlike many games, skills are randomly assigned to characters. Tell a secret: If only one character is selected, all those skills will only be assigned to one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/59a234c14efdcdd1c68e7ba607dd3a75.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fighter system of the game is not complicated at all, it is a relatively simple turn based card battle. No need to build, randomly select cards according to their type and level, easily tackle various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/ad694f2fe8923ade6c4b2211dae53ace.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773810?t=1750756210","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773810?t=1750756210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/cc31275f3855d6aeef7ea24ee9025d4825314e2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750756210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/cc31275f3855d6aeef7ea24ee9025d4825314e2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750756210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/081841a874e06fc1f9c7d49956df9eb7.avif?t=1750756210\" width=800 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SETTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun Wukong, Nezha, and Yang Jian, three legendary Chinese mythological characters, face their destined opponents in life, whether they are gods or demons, and confront them head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/62193fcec1d2e314a16e918eb830aa38.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel style: Exquisite Q-version pixel painting style, awakening memories in the mind with a new style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike gameplay: With each new game, the map room is randomly generated: the positions of enemies, treasure chests, and events change, making every experience full of freshness for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skills: The game has many skills, but unlike many games, skills are randomly assigned to characters. Tell a secret: If only one character is selected, all those skills will only be assigned to one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/59a234c14efdcdd1c68e7ba607dd3a75.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fighter system of the game is not complicated at all, it is a relatively simple turn based card battle. No need to build, randomly select cards according to their type and level, easily tackle various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/ad694f2fe8923ade6c4b2211dae53ace.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["SeeHandBlue"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/aa9cb7f76eaa54f15d52013533d767d73820f0db/header.jpg?t=1750756210","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3773810/1512660805/c6df01e792c76e41d9b2e8f9dde7e1e168d02caa/1750372035/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749559271","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3773810/1512660805/c6df01e792c76e41d9b2e8f9dde7e1e168d02caa/1750372035/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749559271","highlight":true,"hls_h2